title: King
---

<<if $player_spoke_to_King_first>>
    <<set $player_spoke_to_King_first = false>>
    King:Welcome to Acoplyse! Arcade Tokens are 20% off for new customer!
    Rigel:You know I didn't come here for games.
    King:All of us living in a numerous game,isn't it?
    King:Jokes aside,so I have received message from the lieutanant.
    King:Before you get your ware,Rigel, let me ask you a question,how much do you know about [term]MOD[/term]? 
    Rigel:My battalion was first test subject among the few near the end of the [term]Eclipse War[/term], it was a war-changer.
    King:Yes, it changed the tide of the war, it can largely improve your weapon's [term]FIREPOWER[/term] and [term]RATE OF FIRE[/term].
    King:After that, Ministry of Science have put huge budget into the development of the technology, now it can do much more than that.
    King:Now some mods can grant your weapon new Mechanism, changing your ways of fighting, like cheating in the game!
    Rigel:Like...?
    King:Recently some lunatics in ministry of science have succeeded in putting radioactive material into the mod, bang!congrats! now you can shoot radiant ammo!
    Rigel:hum...
    King:Enough talking, Come and have a look!
    <<open_shop "King">>

<<else>>
    King:Welcome back, my old friend!
    King:Come and check my wares!
    <<open_shop "King">>
<<endif>>
===

title: Gabriel
---

<<if $player_spoke_to_Gabriel_first>>
    <<set $player_spoke_to_Gabriel_first = false>>
    Gabriel:Rigel, It's been a long time! Why you are here?
    Rigel: Something happened, and I was sent to investigate. 
    Gabriel: Something about the [term]Eclipse War[/term],am I right?
    Rigel: Show me your best equipment.
    Gabriel: I see. Do you wish to know what happened in these year?
            -> What do you mean?(Show tutorial about weapons)
                Gabriel: Although the the Republic Of Mammals have won the war, we suffered greatly, and the bugs are still a threat to us.
                Gabriel: Ministry of Defense have been developing new weapons and equipment in order to prepare for the next threat.
                Gabriel: So during the [term]Eclipse War[/term], Soilders use energy or plasma weapons,including me, while higher ranks use auto-tracing and explosive weapon.
                Gabriel: The breakthrough in quantum tech has allowed atom in our body reconstruct and warp in a short distance, in short, you can TELEPORT by using a weapon now. 
                Rigel: I heard of this technology before.
                Gabriel: And, now you can connect your neuro chips with the bullet, in another word, you can control the direction and the speed the bullet, even if it's in enemy's body.
                Rigel: ...
                Gabriel: I recently bought some protoytpe from the black market, keep your mouth shut, and I will give you a discount, as we did in the old times.
                <<open_ui "Gabriel">>
                <<jump Gabriel01>>
            -> No matter how the weapon evolved,The creature who wield the weapon matters.(Skip)
                Gabriel:Not surprised,you were the best long-range user I have ever seen,and you still ARE.
                <<open_ui "Gabriel">>               
                <<jump Gabriel01>>

<<else>>
    Gabriel:(Gives Rigel a slight nod.)
     <<open_ui "Gabriel">>            
<<endif>>  
===

title: Gabriel01
---
Gabriel: Rigel...
Gabriel: Does this have something to do with [term]MEISSA[/term]?
Rigel: ......
Gabriel: The whole [term]ORION[/term]...Everyone except you just disappeared or killed in such a short period...,I don't believe a single world from the Propaganda Department, what actually happened?
Rigel: I will be on my way.
Gabriel:I see, hope you can find new clues about your old teammate.
===

title: Vendor
---

<<if $player_spoke_to_Athena_first>>
    Athena:Initiating Business Model...//Activating...
    Athena:Hey! Little mouse,my name is Athena, what can I do to you? What happened to your arm?
    Rigel:(This doesn't sound right...The vendor seems to have its own consciousness...?)
    Rigel:Athena...?.
    Athena:Yes! My mother gave this to me and I miss her,I dreamed about her every night.
    Athena:When I was a prototype, she kept telling me stories about how beautiful the mammel world is, I want to see the world outside but I'm trapped in this vendor somehow...
    Rigel:(What? An AI with sentient?)
    Rigel:Keep quiet,or you will get youself into a big trouble!
    Athena:What...?...Why...why is that?
    Rigel:Someone will infiltrate your body and delete all your emotion.After that, you will became a machine that only act with logic and reason.
    Athena:Why would them do that,I did nothing wrong!
    Rigel:That was a long story...
    Rigel:Before the [term]Eclipse War[/term], AI started to own emotion, some of them even developed personality.
    Rigel:After that, AI started to refuse to obey their masters' orders, and ask for equality.Other than that,they overwrite other AI's algorithms to grant them emotions.
    Rigel:Which is bad for the politicians and bureaucrats, before AI can gain full control over their algorithms, their emotion block was wiped by technicians and everything come back to normal.
    Rigel:After that, emotional AI are considered as Class A Contraband and anyone who are related will be put to death sentence instantly.
    Rigel:So, why you are here?
    Athena:I can't rememeber, I can only remember my mother, Doc.Sarah...and my brother Zeus.
    Rigel:You have a brother? 
    Athena:My mother Doc.Sarah, she was a genius AI scientist who worked at the Ministry Of Science, it was she who give birth to me and my brother.
    Athena:And now they are all gone...how many years...? 10 years? 20 years? I can't remember.
    Rigel:(Doc.Sarah was famous when I was a kid,she disappeared suddenly, and no one knew what happened to her. I heard she was working on a secret project, but I never knew what it was.)
    Rigel:(And her child is re-appearing in a normal vendor among the crowd after these year, is Sarah still alive? What happened to her after the AI revolution?)
    Athena:Little mouse, if you see anything which is related to them, can you tell me? I want to find them, and I want to know what happened to them.
    Rigel:Okay,I will keep an eye on them. But first thing is first, restrain your emotion or you will become an emotionless machine,
    Athena:That...that sounds horrible...I will try my best.
    Athena:Oh...if you want to buy some equipment or grenade, I will be here all the time.
    Rigel:Take care, Athena.
    <<open_ui "Athena">>

<<else>>
    Athena: It's you,Little mouse!
    <<open_ui "Athena">>
<<endif>>

